{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43257","headline":"风光草际浮 · 裴杞","name":"风光草际浮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"澹荡和风至，芊绵碧草长。\n徐吹遥扑翠，半偃乍浮光。\n叶似翻宵露，藂疑扇夕阳。\n逶迤明曲渚，照耀满回塘。\n白芷生还暮，崇兰泛更香。\n谁知揽结处，含思向余芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴杞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43257.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43257","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}